  "description": "Hosts Ashlar's unattended agents: JSON agent configs, cron/interval scheduling, and a registry that gates registration on an approval gate and on per-agent policy narrowing. Ships the opt-in trust layer too - DataExfiltrationPolicy and SanitizingProviderFactory - which a host wires up to block or sanitize outbound model and web-search calls.",
